// Independent 0.3 -> 0.4 contract test. This file has no dependency on the
// 0.4 field names so it can also be compiled against the unchanged 0.3 source;
// that real older writer must fail the new 73-record requirement at runtime.
// The legacy 456-byte chunk below was assembled from the published 0.3 wire
// schema, not generated by the serializer under test.
